<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA barley export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>There were no sales reported for the week.</p>
<p>Exports of 2,200 MT--all to Mexico--were down 2 percent from the prior week and 89 percent below the 4-week average.</p>
</text>
